text:
The bowl looks like it holds diced cooked chicken breast with sliced red onion and shredded carrot. I estimate about 250 g of chicken, 40 g of onion and 15 g of carrot, so roughly 305 g in total.

Chicken breast is about 165 kcal per 100 g, so 250 g gives roughly 412 kcal. The onion adds about 16 kcal and the carrot about 6 kcal. That comes to about 435 kcal. Because the chicken is possibly tofu or lightly seasoned, I rounded down slightly to 420 kcal.

